10. Refresh procedure
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

To refresh this file after dependency upgrades:

    flutter pub get
    flutter pub deps --no-dev --style=compact

For each new or upgraded dependency, locate its license file (typically
`LICENSE`, `LICENSE.md`) under `~/.pub-cache/hosted/pub.dev/<name>-<version>/`
and either add a new section here or extend the relevant existing section.

After any change to `tool/bundled_engines.yaml`, re-check §1 — a version
bump can move an upstream project between licenses, and a newly bundled
engine adds a new attribution and possibly a new distribution obligation.

